Actually simpler: write STOP frame and don't await:
```js
try {
  const payload = Buffer.from(JSON.stringify({command:"STOP"}),"utf8")
  const header = Buffer.alloc(4); header.writeUInt32BE(payload.length)
  control.write(Buffer.concat([header, payload]))
} catch {}
```
then `control.end()`. That avoids the hang. Let me implement a `sendControlNoWait`.

